## The City of Gnome.

## Room 78. LOOK.BAS 7800 and 7850.

create the Gate
  a room
  room name:
    Gate
  exits, one-way: north to the City of Gnome, south to the Sphere Room

  You are at the gate of the City of Gnome, one of the three{br}
  ancient underground cities. On your west is a steep cliff.

## Room 79. LOOK.BAS 7900 and 7950.

create the City of Gnome
  a room
  room name:
    City of Gnome
  exits, one-way: north to the Alaska Room, east to the Closet 80, south to the Gate

  You are in the City of Gnome.There are passages north and south.

## Room 80. LOOK.BAS 8000 and 8050.

create the Closet 80
  a room
  room name:
    Closet
  exits, one-way: west to the City of Gnome, out to the City of Gnome

  You are in one of the closets in the City of Gnome.

## Room 81. LOOK.BAS 8100 and 8150.

create the Closet 81
  a room
  room name:
    Closet
  exits, one-way: south to the Room 83, out to the Room 83

  You are in one of the closets in the City of Gnome.

## Room 82. LOOK.BAS 8200 and 8250.

create the Alaska Room
  a room
  room name:
    Alaska room
  exits, one-way: north to the Room 84, south to the City of Gnome

  This is the Alaska room. The temperature is a balmy 40 degrees{br}
  below zero (233 degrees Kelvin).

## Room 83. LOOK.BAS 8300 and 8350.

create the Room 83
  a room
  room name:
    This room has exits NW and North.
  exits, one-way: north to the Closet 81, northwest to the Room 84

  This room has exits NW and North.

## Room 84. LOOK.BAS 8400 and 8450.

create the Room 84
  a room
  room name:
    You are in a room with exits S and SE.
  exits, one-way: west to the Alaska Room, northwest to the Room 83

  You are in a room with exits S and SE.
